  <content>
  <section><para>Veronica works two part time jobs in order to earn enough money to meet her obligations of at least $280 a week. Her job at the day spa pays $10 an hour and her administrative assistant job on campus pays $17.50 an hour. </para>
<para>Which of the following is a solution that allows Veronica to earn enough money?</para>
 </section>
